     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "Sing us a song, you’re the piano man, sing us a song tonight.",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    },
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "Well, we’re all in the mood for a melody, and you’ve got us feelin’ alright.",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      },
      {
       "type": "Cue",
       "label": "S1",
       "target": 1
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "Block",
   "kind": "",
   "number": "3",
   "lines": [
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "Now John at the bar is a friend of mine, he gets me my drinks for free,",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    },
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "and he’s quick with a joke or to light up your smoke,",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    },
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "but there’s some place that he’d rather be.",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "Block",
   "kind": "",
   "number": "4",
   "lines": [
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "He says, \"Bill, I believe this is killing me,\" as the smile ran away from his face,",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    },
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "\"Well, I’m sure that I could be a movie star if I could get out of this place\".",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      },
      {
       "type": "Cue",
       "label": "S2",
       "target": 4
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "Block",
   "kind": "",
   "number": "5",
   "lines": [
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "Now Paul is a real estate novelist, who never had time for a wife.",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    },
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "And he’s talkin’ with Davy, who’s still in the Navy and probably will be for life.",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "Block",
   "kind": "",
   "number": "6",
   "lines": [
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "And the waitress is practicing politics, as the businessmen slowly get stoned.",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    },
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
      {
       "type": "Segment",
       "chord": null,
       "text": [
        {
         "type": "Run",
         "text": "Yes, they’re sharing a drink they call loneliness,",
         "style": []
        }
       ],
       "in_word": false
      }
     ],
     "group_start": false
    },
    {
     "type": "Line",
     "items": [
